</style></div></div><div class="pricing-comparison_calc-toggle-wrapper"><div class="w-form"><form id="email-form" name="email-form" data-name="Email Form" method="get" data-wf-page-id="6432f5dd5c88a35f523f72cd" data-wf-element-id="36d20cbc-5531-1a5e-7369-82a8e5202db6" data-turnstile-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAAQTptj2So4dx43e"><label class="w-checkbox checkbox-field"><div class="w-checkbox-input w-checkbox-input--inputType-custom pricing-comparison_toggle"></div><input type="checkbox" id="switch" name="checkbox" data-name="Checkbox" style="opacity:0;position:absolute;z-index:-1"/><span class="text-size-regular w-form-label" for="checkbox">Annual discount</span></label></form><div class="w-form-done"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="margin-top margin-xlarge"><a href="#" data-w-id="367758b8-6032-76f5-b5c3-0607e55adee2" class="button-secondary_pricing background-color-pink-200 w-inline-block"><div>View email marketing features</div><div class="button-secondary-icon-wrapper"><div class="button-secondary-icon-row"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/6347244ba8d63455cf51c0d7_chevron%20button%20icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="arrow icon" class="button-secondary-icon"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/6347244ba8d63455cf51c0d7_chevron%20button%20icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="arrow icon" class="button-secondary-icon"/></div></div></a></div></div></div><div id="View-ecommerce-features" style="height:0px" class="pricing-cards_component is-1 w-node-_4be9a129-0a66-d3a4-a3e3-59edb2212946-523f72cd"><div class="page-padding padding-none"><div class="container is-large"><div class="pricing-cards_list"><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">01</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">Accept online payments</h3><p>Don&#x27;t worry about merchant accounts and billing logic. <strong>Choose per seat, usage-based and more</strong>. Customize as little or as much as you like.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">02</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-medium">Recurring billing + subscriptions</h3><p>Charge customers on a weekly, monthly, or yearly basis. <strong>Manage upgrades, downgrades, and cancels</strong>. Offer free trials, discounts, and more.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">03</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">License key management</h3><p>Automatically issue license keys for your software and apps after each sale. <strong>Deactivate, re-issue, and have full control</strong> over license management.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">04</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">Sell digital downloads</h3><p>Anyone can provide download links,  but what about security and abuse? Your <strong>download links are securely signed</strong>, throttled, and more.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">05</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-medium">No-code checkout forms</h3><p>No matter what you use for your website, you can <strong>embed your checkout or share your unique checkout links</strong> and sell anywhere.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">06</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">Launch your ecommerce store</h3><p>Build an ecommerce website in minutes <strong>without coding or design skills</strong>. Customizable, SSL secured and mobile-optimized as standard.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">07</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-medium">Discounts + coupon codes</h3><p>Generate unique coupon codes to reward your customers and <strong>nudge visitors closer to purchasing</strong> with one singular view to manage it all.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">08</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-medium">Create bundles + upsells</h3><p>Sell your products individually, or bundle them together in unique collections to <strong>earn more expansion revenue</strong> instantly.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">09</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-small">Sales tax + VAT collection</h3><p>Lemon Squeezy is your merchant of record. <strong>We take on the liability of tax collection and calculation</strong> and pay taxes on your behalf.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">10</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">Support major payment methods</h3><p>With Lemon Squeezy, you can <strong>accept up to 21 payment methods</strong>, including PayPal, all under one roof. We also shoulder the burden of VAT / taxes.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">11</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-large">Grow with lead magnets</h3><p>Gain attention with freebies and “Pay what you want” donations, and <strong>turn subscribers into customers</strong>. Watch your email list grow overnight.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">12</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">Recover lost payments</h3><p>More than just card retries. From abandoned carts to failed payment recovery, <strong>understand where your leaky buckets are</strong> and how to fix them.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">13</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-medium">Real-time revenue insights</h3><p>Have peace of mind <strong>monitoring your most valuable metrics</strong> relating to your business. From MRR, refunds, average order value, and more.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">14</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">A.I. fraud protection</h3><p>Lemon Squeezy’s A.I. fraud system allows us to <strong>assess risk more accurately</strong>, reduce chargebacks, and accept more payments.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-green-700">15</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-medium">Add your custom domain</h3><p>On top of having control of your products, customers, subscriptions, and more, you can also <strong>add a custom domain to your store</strong> to make it yours.</p></a></div></div></div></div><div id="View-email-marketing-features" style="height:0px" class="pricing-cards_component is-2 w-node-_3d6dc694-3580-08c2-9b72-24616d316c34-523f72cd"><div class="page-padding padding-none"><div class="container is-large"><div class="pricing-cards_list"><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-pink-700">01</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">Email marketing made easy</h3><p>Combining e-commerce and email marketing gives you context to finally <strong>send emails like you know your customers</strong> — because you do.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-pink-700">02</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-large">Avoid the spam folders</h3><p>Leverage Lemon Squeezy’s glowing reputation and increase your delivery rates to <strong>land more emails in more inboxes</strong> without the hassle.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-pink-700">03</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">Track email performance</h3><p>Frequently communicating with your audience is half the battle. <strong>Learn how your message is being received</strong> so you can course correct quickly.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-pink-700">04</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-medium">Understand your audience</h3><p>By having your ecommerce and email data in one central location, you can <strong>connect with your audience</strong> in a whole new way. Context matters.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-pink-700">05</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black">Automatic segmentation</h3><p><strong>Intelligent segments automatically update</strong> depending on how customers interact with your products, packages, and lists — like magic.</p></a><a href="#" class="pricing-cards_item w-inline-block"><div class="pricing-cards_item-header"><div class="text-style-title text-color-pink-700">06</div><div class="pricing-cards_item-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 10.6023L5.36932 9.59091L8.92045 6.03977H0V4.5625H8.92045L5.36932 1.01705L6.39205 0L11.6932 5.30114L6.39205 10.6023Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-medium text-color-black pr-micro">Real-time customer profiles</h3><p>Gain a <strong>better understanding of your subscribers&#x27; behaviour</strong>, from purchase history, frequency, spending, lifetime value and more.</p></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id="862b5fa5-5549-6803-0cc1-6904badc0795" class="section-top-intro background-color-purple-600"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container"><div data-w-id="862b5fa5-5549-6803-0cc1-6904badc0798" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div data-w-id="862b5fa5-5549-6803-0cc1-6904badc079c" class="service-intro_component"><div id="w-node-_862b5fa5-5549-6803-0cc1-6904badc0799-523f72cd" class="margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="text-style-title text-color-golden">OUR MOdel</div></div><h2 id="w-node-_862b5fa5-5549-6803-0cc1-6904badc079d-523f72cd">We’re all in this together — we win when you win</h2><p id="w-node-_862b5fa5-5549-6803-0cc1-6904badc079f-523f72cd" class="text-color-dim-light section-intro">At the core of Lemon Squeezy, <strong class="text-color-white">our mission is to help people earn a living online</strong>. That means providing the best all-in-one platform for selling and marketing your digital products. Whether you&#x27;re a small startup or an enormous enterprise, get all the features and benefits for exactly $0/mo.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-testimonial-ticker"><div class="testimonial-ticker_component"><div class="testimonial-cards_component"><div class="testimonial-cards_list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="testimonial-cards_list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="testimonial-card_list-item w-dyn-item"><div style="background-color:hsla(310.00000000000006, 90.00%, 96.08%, 1.00)" class="testimonial-card_list-item-content"><blockquote class="testimonial-card_quote">“It’s refreshing to see Lemon Squeezy focusing solely on digital products. Giving you all the necessary tools you’ll need to start selling your products and subscriptions quickly and easily.”</blockquote><div class="testimonial-cards_author-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" alt="Ian Barnard" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63461aa51c0af/6347244ba8d63460a651c12b_6306f448c54a6b9344b5feca_Avatar-5.webp" class="testimonial-cards_author-headshot"/><div class="testimonial-ticker_author-text-wrapper"><div class="text-weight-medium">Ian Barnard</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-grey">@ian_barnard</div></div></div><div style="background-color:hsla(309.8684210526316, 90.48%, 67.06%, 1.00)" class="testimonial-ticker_list-item-underline"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="testimonial-card_list-item w-dyn-item"><div style="background-color:hsla(255, 0.00%, 100.00%, 1.00)" class="testimonial-card_list-item-content"><blockquote class="testimonial-card_quote">“It’s so good to have a system focused on digital products, and it took me no time at all to allow customers to buy fonts straight from my website. There’s so much potential. I can’t wait to see what’s next!”</blockquote><div class="testimonial-cards_author-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" alt="TypeHeist" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63461aa51c0af/6347244ba8d634544851c0d0_63060854382406a84a819e28_Avatar.webp" class="testimonial-cards_author-headshot"/><div class="testimonial-ticker_author-text-wrapper"><div class="text-weight-medium">TypeHeist</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-grey">typeheist.co</div></div></div><div style="background-color:hsla(42.05882352941176, 100.00%, 60.00%, 1.00)" class="testimonial-ticker_list-item-underline"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="testimonial-card_list-item w-dyn-item"><div style="background-color:#fff2ee" class="testimonial-card_list-item-content"><blockquote class="testimonial-card_quote">“Lemon Squeezy is exactly what I have been looking for. The license key management and recurring payments have streamlined my business, and I am looking forward to seeing the platform grow.”</blockquote><div class="testimonial-cards_author-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" alt="UiPress" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63461aa51c0af/634c4f72af899dc0e2f0b67e_uipress.jpg" class="testimonial-cards_author-headshot"/><div class="testimonial-ticker_author-text-wrapper"><div class="text-weight-medium">UiPress</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-grey">uipress.co</div></div></div><div style="background-color:#ff7d52" class="testimonial-ticker_list-item-underline"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="testimonial-card_list-item w-dyn-item"><div style="background-color:hsla(255, 0.00%, 100.00%, 1.00)" class="testimonial-card_list-item-content"><blockquote class="testimonial-card_quote">“I made my first $99/yr sale within the first hour of setup! Finally, an all-in-one solution for makers with multiple products, with the ability to sell with both subscription and one-off pricing. Incredible.”</blockquote><div class="testimonial-cards_author-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" alt="Rob Hope" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63461aa51c0af/634c503499023660858c70d6_robhope.jpg" class="testimonial-cards_author-headshot"/><div class="testimonial-ticker_author-text-wrapper"><div class="text-weight-medium">Rob Hope</div><div class="text-size-small text-color-grey">onepagelove.com</div></div></div><div style="background-color:#2dca72" class="testimonial-ticker_list-item-underline"></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="testimonial-card_list-item w-dyn-item"><div style=