</style></div></div></section><section class="section-top-intro"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container"><div data-w-id="937ddb6e-cd8e-b2d3-141a-94904782b1ed" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="service-intro_component"><div id="w-node-_937ddb6e-cd8e-b2d3-141a-94904782b1ee-523f72cd" class="margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="text-style-title text-color-blue-violet">All-in-one</div></div><h2 id="w-node-_937ddb6e-cd8e-b2d3-141a-94904782b1f2-523f72cd">How much moola will you save with Lemon Squeezy?</h2><p id="w-node-_937ddb6e-cd8e-b2d3-141a-94904782b1f4-523f72cd" class="section-intro">Sure, other platforms allow you to accept payments online but do you know the real hidden costs? As your merchant of record, <strong>get all the solutions you need to sell your digital products</strong> with a simple and easy-to-understand pricing model.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-pricing-table"><div class="page-padding padding-none"><div class="container is-large"><div class="padding-bottom padding-xhuge"><div data-w-id="9279af6e-17f2-30f1-ae8a-7d6814f3619d" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="comparision-table_component"><div class="comparision-table_list-item-heading"><div id="w-node-_3f598712-2432-fe2a-66e1-ca5f86599936-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_heading-row"><div id="w-node-b75e12ba-0806-75d2-d44e-9fca9581df72-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-b75e12ba-0806-75d2-d44e-9fca9581df73-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper is-transparent"><h2 class="text-size-xlarge">Features </h2></div></div><div id="w-node-d93843e6-cf9f-9ad1-18a1-d52adb4f682f-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/6347244ba8d63469e851c0d6_footer%20small%20logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Lemon Squeezy logo" class="comparision-table_logo"/></div><div id="w-node-a96b1481-6fff-0268-ca2c-9da130a62a92-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_header-text-wrapper"><h4 class="text-size-large">Sticky tape solution</h4></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-a3d4235e-c10f-7e0f-724f-16bf29a04603-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-a3d4235e-c10f-7e0f-724f-16bf29a04604-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">01</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Pricing</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">$0/m</div></div></div><div id="w-node-a3d4235e-c10f-7e0f-724f-16bf29a0460d-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">$0/m</div></div><div id="w-node-a3d4235e-c10f-7e0f-724f-16bf29a04610-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">$0 — $399/m</div></div><div id="w-node-b7a048fb-40f3-17a2-30c7-50773824cfc8-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to $0 — $399/m with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Sign up for Lemon Squeezy and take it for a test drive for free — no strings attached, no card required. Every feature is included and free to use.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_3c0d2f69-0e18-a8a0-b59c-ab05272ad771-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_3c0d2f69-0e18-a8a0-b59c-ab05272ad772-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">02</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Transaction fees</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">5% + 50¢</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_3c0d2f69-0e18-a8a0-b59c-ab05272ad77b-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">5% + 50¢</div></div><div id="w-node-_3c0d2f69-0e18-a8a0-b59c-ab05272ad77e-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ 2.9% — 12% + 50¢</div></div><div id="w-node-_0d16e75c-d56d-05cc-8486-fc298f7e7bfe-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + 2.9% — 12% + 50¢ with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">There is no monthly fee to use Lemon Squeezy for payment processing. Our pricing is aligned with you, and you only pay when you generate sales.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_54fa9432-83f2-3f71-500e-e32afa29d2cc-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_54fa9432-83f2-3f71-500e-e32afa29d2cd-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">03</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Additional payment methods</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_54fa9432-83f2-3f71-500e-e32afa29d2d6-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_54fa9432-83f2-3f71-500e-e32afa29d2d8-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ 0.5% — 1%</div></div><div id="w-node-_1af55387-4ffa-ef9d-62f6-2560c4750755-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + 0.5% — 1% with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Out of the box, you will have 16 different payment methods, including PayPal. View all of your reconciled revenue in one simple dashboard.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_754642ec-ecbf-ea0f-4e62-bd221bf87c95-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_754642ec-ecbf-ea0f-4e62-bd221bf87c96-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">04</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Global currency support</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_754642ec-ecbf-ea0f-4e62-bd221bf87c9f-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_754642ec-ecbf-ea0f-4e62-bd221bf87ca1-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ 0.5% — 1%</div></div><div id="w-node-cc9ddcd0-6f11-802d-f811-8a4a1d708f01-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + 0.5% — 1% with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Instantly sell your digital products globally with support for up 95 different currencies. Transactions made outside of the US may encounter small additional <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/getting-started/fees" target="_blank" class="text-style-link">fees</a>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_9499a684-392f-b4e1-3a61-1532f9d9bb43-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_9499a684-392f-b4e1-3a61-1532f9d9bb44-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">05</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Global VAT + sales tax collection</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_9499a684-392f-b4e1-3a61-1532f9d9bb4d-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" alt="" width="40" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_9499a684-392f-b4e1-3a61-1532f9d9bb4f-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ 0.5%</div></div><div id="w-node-f7aa0abe-0ce3-fca2-3aed-440ad9acb679-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + 0.5% with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Lemon Squeezy is your merchant of record. We take on tax collection and calculation liability across all jurisdictions so that you can sell with confidence.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_40b3b009-a7bd-989f-62ae-fbe51b1560ff-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_40b3b009-a7bd-989f-62ae-fbe51b156100-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">06</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">International VAT + sales tax filing</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_40b3b009-a7bd-989f-62ae-fbe51b156109-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_40b3b009-a7bd-989f-62ae-fbe51b15610b-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ $200 — $5000/m</div></div><div id="w-node-_018047c4-3995-3d54-36be-b9aacd903944-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + $200 — $5000/m with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Lemon Squeezy provides more than just tax calculation and collection. As your merchant of record, we’re also registered to file and pay taxes on your behalf.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_5ca53b00-ed8a-f5f5-2bdf-46868ea7c90c-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_5ca53b00-ed8a-f5f5-2bdf-46868ea7c90d-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">07</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Fraud protection</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_5ca53b00-ed8a-f5f5-2bdf-46868ea7c916-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_5ca53b00-ed8a-f5f5-2bdf-46868ea7c918-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ 0.5%</div></div><div id="w-node-_08c13e38-bc17-4be6-f1a9-075386ff27cf-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + 0.5% with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Lemon Squeezy’s A.I. fraud system allows us to assess risk more accurately, reduce chargebacks, and accept more payments.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_24a6eae2-b8fa-ea0a-0c22-eb366a3e5da0-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_24a6eae2-b8fa-ea0a-0c22-eb366a3e5da1-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">08</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Abandoned cart recovery</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_24a6eae2-b8fa-ea0a-0c22-eb366a3e5daa-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_24a6eae2-b8fa-ea0a-0c22-eb366a3e5dac-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ 10% — 30%</div></div><div id="w-node-c4d18357-3cd5-e209-de02-531a63ff8b74-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + 10% — 30% with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Instantly enable your store to recover abandoned carts with built-in recovery. Emails are triggered based on timed events to increase conversion.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_781b00b5-360d-f832-5015-6444ea4a3087-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_781b00b5-360d-f832-5015-6444ea4a3088-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">09</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Failed payment recovery</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_781b00b5-360d-f832-5015-6444ea4a3091-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" alt="" width="40" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_781b00b5-360d-f832-5015-6444ea4a3093-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ 10% — 30%</div></div><div id="w-node-c96fc2c0-9ffd-452c-e8f4-a0ce046a7c03-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + 10% — 30% with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Capture failed payments with customizable email reminders, hosted checkout forms, and real-time analytics to track recovered revenue.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_3cc85568-fdcc-1988-5079-91cfeea8e666-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_3cc85568-fdcc-1988-5079-91cfeea8e667-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">10</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Reporting + analytics</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_3cc85568-fdcc-1988-5079-91cfeea8e670-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_3cc85568-fdcc-1988-5079-91cfeea8e672-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">+ $20 — $500/m</div></div><div id="w-node-_49f95b7a-665b-15e5-6988-729f6d64ba32-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to + $20 — $500/m with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">Gain a better understanding of key metrics so you can understand your business needs, up your marketing and take your revenue to new heights.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="comparision-table_list-item"><div class="comparision-table_row"><div id="w-node-_52a7cd6b-d1b6-c054-46f2-4f6a5121c5e2-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><div id="w-node-_52a7cd6b-d1b6-c054-46f2-4f6a5121c5e3-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_feature-heading-wrapper"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-blue-violet">11</div><h3 class="comparision-table_heading">Customer billing support</h3><div class="comparision-table_feature-mobile">Included</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_52a7cd6b-d1b6-c054-46f2-4f6a5121c5ec-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/641889489e5e971b2ffabd6c_tick.png" loading="lazy" alt="" width="40" class="comparision-table_feature-icon"/></div><div id="w-node-_52a7cd6b-d1b6-c054-46f2-4f6a5121c5ee-523f72cd" class="comparision-table_feature hide-mobile"><div class="text-size-large">~$60k/y pp</div></div><div id="w-node-cbd96d51-fc92-d32c-fe0c-0004a7dfab36-523f72cd" class="pricing-table_list-item-paragraph-wrapper"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><div class="text-size-normal show-mobile">compared to ~$60k/y pp with a sticky tape solution</div></div><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p class="text-size-normal">When leveraging Lemon Squeezy as your merchant of record, we handle tax burdens and take on the liability and support for billing issues.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="hide w-embed"><style>
