s="button-primary-text">Contact sales</div><div class="button-primary-icon w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6.39205 11.2102L5.36932 10.1988L8.92045 6.64768H0V5.17041H8.92045L5.36932 1.62496L6.39205 0.60791L11.6932 5.90905L6.39205 11.2102Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_922650dd-a1ac-f7a6-f16a-342fc3402926-523f72cd" data-w-id="922650dd-a1ac-f7a6-f16a-342fc3402926" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(2.2rem, 2.2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(2.2rem, 2.2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(2.2rem, 2.2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(2.2rem, 2.2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="feature-layout_image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/6352651445a3159aca14d7db_custom.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" id="w-node-_0db11404-62a4-aded-7f50-df44a6b9d661-523f72cd" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/6352651445a3159aca14d7db_custom-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/6352651445a3159aca14d7db_custom-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/6352651445a3159aca14d7db_custom-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/6352651445a3159aca14d7db_custom.jpg 1440w" class="feature-layout_image is-absolute"/></div></div></div><div class="bg-color_wrapper-fixed is-zindex-2"><div class="bg-color_element background-color-black"></div></div></section><section data-w-id="ae11be65-6519-cfd3-cb10-e8a320b6fff2" class="section-faq"><div class="content_relative"><div data-w-id="3e225aed-11c2-c798-a914-f74f83ca63d9" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="page-padding"><div class="container"><div data-w-id="3e225aed-11c2-c798-a914-f74f83ca63db" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="padding-top padding-xhuge"><div class="service-intro_component"><div id="w-node-_3e225aed-11c2-c798-a914-f74f83ca63dc-523f72cd" class="margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="text-style-title text-color-voilet-red">All-in-one</div></div><h2 id="w-node-_3e225aed-11c2-c798-a914-f74f83ca63e0-523f72cd">There are no stupid questions — ask away, we’re all ears</h2><p id="w-node-_6d4df76b-7fea-b0b6-6c34-8b7d5716ad9e-523f72cd" class="section-intro">We get it. Committing to a new payment platform can be a tough decision. Below are some of the most popular questions when deciding whether or not Lemon Squeezy is suitable for you.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="page-padding faq-block"><div class="container is-large"><div data-w-id="ae11be65-6519-cfd3-cb10-e8a320b6fff5" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 2rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="accordion_component"><div class="accordion_list"><div class="accordion_item"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">01</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Do I need a credit card to sign up?</h3><div id="w-node-be9bd6fb-8f5f-e3aa-7cc1-03bcd8598c47-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Nope. You can sign up for Lemon Squeezy and take it for a test drive for free — no strings attached, no card required. If you choose to upgrade to a paid plan later, you will enter your payment<!-- --> app.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">02</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Can I cancel anytime?</h3><div id="w-node-c7f3c04a-47ab-ca78-11c8-c8887d9ca634-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" alt="" width="40" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Absolutely. There are no long-term commitments or contracts. No hard feelings should we part ways — we want you to find the best solution for you.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">03</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Can I sell subscriptions?</h3><div id="w-node-_57ebc4a6-a1ed-c353-405e-a985f5d43102-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Whether you’re selling widgets, courses, or software, you can charge on a weekly, monthly, or yearly basis. Moreover, you have complete control over charging one-time or recurring fees within the same product.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">04</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">How and when do I get paid?</h3><div id="w-node-_5626b27a-b368-1982-6dbe-caa5a9cab34c-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Lemon Squeezy supports bank wire and PayPal payouts, which are automatically processed into your preferred method twice a month. In total, more than 200 countries are supported. <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/getting-started/getting-paid" target="_blank" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">Learn more →</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">05</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Are you the merchant of record?</h3><div id="w-node-c1859267-5356-2e96-ec91-442491b5b525-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Yep. Rid yourself of the burden and legal responsibility of collecting and reporting Tax and EU VAT. As Merchant of Record, Lemon Squeezy handles that for you so you can concentrate on running your business. <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/payments/merchant-of-record" target="_blank" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">Learn more →</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">06</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Can I sell in other countries?</h3><div id="w-node-_7f7b4565-a79f-0c46-609f-45b868d6a5aa-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Of course. Lemon Squeezy supports 130+ different currencies. <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/payments/currencies" target="_blank" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">Learn more →</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">07</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">What if I already have a website?</h3><div id="w-node-_6eafb33a-6f0f-c290-cac4-2efad6023e72-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Not a problem. When you create products with Lemon Squeezy, you can share your products on any website, newsletter, social platform, and more. You can choose to use as much or little of the platform as you need. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xb9hqA7uStE" target="_blank" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">Learn more →</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">08</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">What can I sell with Lemon Squeezy?</h3><div id="w-node-_96f48031-5f57-eadb-4b80-c8e9185efc73-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Lemon Squeezy was designed to support digital products. You can sell digital products ranging from SaaS, digital downloads, subscriptions, memberships, courses, and more. If you’re looking for a list of prohibited products, please review our documentation.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">09</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Can I send emails?</h3><div id="w-node-e8fb65f5-feb2-c98a-5bf3-c1a4a84b0f16-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Absolutely. Send customized newsletters, avoid spam folders, and get personal with your customers. Every customer that purchases your products is added as an email subscriber. You can also easily import and export your subscribers too. <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/email" target="_blank" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">Learn more →</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">10</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">How does my email plan work?</h3><div id="w-node-_12495aab-436f-b075-f60a-7710b3722f23-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Email plans are in addition to your ecommerce plan. Pricing is based on the number of subscribers you have. You can upgrade, downgrade, and cancel at any time. <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/email" target="_blank" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">Learn more →</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">11</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Do you have an API or developer resources?</h3><div id="w-node-f2e73eb3-d588-9634-595e-5768b22dbce5-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Yes. With our API, you can customize Lemon Squeezy to do exactly what you need. Be sure to checkout our API docs. <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/api" target="_blank" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">Learn more →</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">12</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Can you help if I get stuck?</h3><div id="w-node-_820a2f62-2bcf-8e6f-96f9-0834b41e3e7f-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>Of course. You can always reach our support team via our <a href="/help" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">help center</a>. Response time is 24-48 hours. Additionally, you can check out our <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">help docs</a>, getting started <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/guides" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">guides</a> or <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/api" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">API reference</a>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion_item margin-horizontal"><div class="accordion_item-box"><div class="accordion_question"><div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-voilet-red">13</div><h3 class="text-size-xlarge">Could fees ever exceed 5% + 50¢ per transaction?</h3><div id="w-node-_9a228225-466b-ea9b-9375-5c56db66c4b7-523f72cd" class="accordion_question-icon-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/64188b740fa915b62a59881a_plus.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></div></div><div class="accordion_answer"><div class="padding-top padding-xmedium"><p>We’ve worked hard to keep our fees as low and as simple as possible. We consolidate complex platform fees into one simple transaction fee of 5% + 50¢, but there are edge cases where small additional fees may need to be applied. You can find out more about those fees and when they might be applied. <a href="https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/getting-started/fees" target="_blank" class="text-style-link text-color-voilet">Learn More →</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="bg-color_wrapper-fixed"><div class="bg-color_element background-color-pink-50"></div></div></section><div data-w-id="e7b92bb3-423d-63b1-d132-2869e876b283" class="section-support"><div class="bg-color_wrapper-fixed"><div class="bg-color_element background-color-lavender-blush"></div></div><div class="content_relative"><div class="feature-layout_component is-content-right"><div id="w-node-e7b92bb3-423d-63b1-d132-2869e876b288-e876b283" class="feature-layout_image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/63527be0d581062375ca2ea2_guide.jpg" loading="lazy" data-w-id="e7b92bb3-423d-63b1-d132-2869e876b289" sizes="100vw" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/63527be0d581062375ca2ea2_guide-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/63527be0d581062375ca2ea2_guide-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/63527be0d581062375ca2ea2_guide-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6347244ba8d63489ba51c08e/63527be0d581062375ca2ea2_guide.jpg 1440w" class="feature-layout_image"/></div><div id="w-node-e7b92bb3-423d-63b1-d132-2869e876b28a-e876b283" class="feature-layout_content-wrapper is-right"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xxlarge"><div class="page-padding"><div class="margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="text-style-title text-color-voilet">s/1</div></div><h3>Creator Guide</h3><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><p>Looking for some advice on how to sell and market your digital products? Download the creator’s guide to dive deep into getting your idea off the ground.</p></div><div class="margin-top margin-large"><div class="button-wrapper"><a href="https://makelemonade.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/0929c351-abb3-49f7-a671-ba15406517dd?embed=1" class="button-secondary is-rounded is-small lemonsqueezy-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-secondary-icon-wrapper is-small"><div class="button-secondary-icon